# game/ch15.rpy:17
translate english ch15_a34975c0:

    # n "期末考试结束的周六，阳光正好。爸爸妈妈出门办事，阿狐独自在家，难得清闲。"
    n "The Saturday after final exams, with the sun shining bright. Mom and Dad were out on errands, and Ahu had the rare luxury of the house to himself."

# game/ch15.rpy:18
translate english ch15_1a5850dc:

    # n "这一年，他实打实经历了一连串交锋：识破过假客服的「免费皮肤」，拆穿过盗号冒充小兔的借钱骗局，挂断过冒充公检法的诈骗电话，还拦下过假「爸爸」的视频求助。"
    n "Over the past year he had fought through a string of real battles: seen through a fake support agent's \"free skins\", exposed a hacker impersonating Xiaotu to borrow money, hung up on fake-police scam calls, and stopped a phony \"Dad\" video plea."

# game/ch15.rpy:19
translate english ch15_2a7f37c3:

    # n "班里同学都叫他「反诈小卫士」，连老师都在班会上表扬过他。时间一长，阿狐心里悄悄冒出一个念头——"
    n "His classmates called him the \"Anti-Fraud Guardian\", and even the teacher praised him at class meetings. Over time, a thought quietly sprouted in Ahu's mind —"

# game/ch15.rpy:20
translate english ch15_4d007c55:

    # think laugh "什么骗局我没见过？现在的骗子再来，我一眼就能看穿！"
    think laugh "What scam haven't I seen? If a scammer comes now, I'll see through them at a glance!"

# game/ch15.rpy:21
translate english ch15_20e0035c:

    # n "他不知道的是，一场专为「有经验的人」准备的连环骗局，已经盯上了他。这一次，骗局的剧本全面升级：信息更精准、道具更逼真、环环相扣、层层加码。"
    n "What he didn't know was that a chain of scams designed specially for \"experienced people\" had already marked him. This time the script was fully upgraded: more precise information, more realistic props, linked ring by ring, escalating step by step."

# game/ch15.rpy:22
translate english ch15_cee8049e:

    # n "上午十点整，手机同时弹出两条消息。终极试炼，开始了。"
    n "At ten in the morning, two notifications arrived at the same time. The final trial had begun."

# game/ch15.rpy:26
translate english ch15_82c5f363:

    # n "第一条消息来自游戏群，昵称「周年庆福利官」的人喊得火热。"
    n "The first message came from the game group, where someone nicknamed \"Anniversary Benefits Officer\" was shouting up a storm."

# game/ch15.rpy:27
translate english ch15_7c5ef9c0:

    # fraud laugh "游戏周年庆最后一天！点击链接领取限定礼包+888点券，未成年玩家专属，过期清零！"
    fraud laugh "Last day of the game's anniversary! Tap the link for a limited gift pack + 888 vouchers — exclusive to underage players, gone when the day ends!"

# game/ch15.rpy:28
translate english ch15_a0e76afd:

    # n "第二条，是一个陌生账号的加好友申请——头像、昵称和真班主任一模一样，自称「王老师」。"
    n "The second was a friend request from a stranger — same avatar, same nickname as his real head teacher, calling itself \"Mr. Wang\"."

# game/ch15.rpy:29
translate english ch15_74fe49d3:

    # l15_teacher serious "阿狐同学，我是王老师。这次期中你进步很大，考进了班级第9名，老师都记着呢。"
    l15_teacher serious "Ahu, this is Mr. Wang. You made big progress on the midterms — ninth in the class. Teacher remembers."

# game/ch15.rpy:30
translate english ch15_dacd4903:

    # think confused "咦？连我考第9都知道……看来真是王老师本人？"
    think confused "Huh? He even knows I ranked ninth... So it really is Mr. Wang?"

# game/ch15.rpy:31
translate english ch15_3c4826d5:

    # l15_teacher serious "是这样，学校临时通知收取200元复习资料费，今天下午5点前截止。你直接转到老师这个私人账户就行，别在群里声张——老师只单独通知了几个班干部。"
    l15_teacher serious "Here's the thing: the school suddenly announced a 200-yuan review-materials fee, due by 5 p.m. today. Just transfer it to my personal account, and keep it quiet — teacher only told a few class officers."

# game/ch15.rpy:45
translate english ch15_A_0f53e76d:

    # n "信息说得再准，阿狐也没有乱。他心里只有一条铁律：核实，只用自己掌握的渠道。"
    n "However accurate the information, Ahu stayed steady. He held to one iron rule: verification only through channels he controls."

# game/ch15.rpy:46
translate english ch15_A_d5ff8d5e:

    # think serious "我的班级、名次，班级群截图和学校公示里都有——个人信息早就不是秘密。骗子知道得越多，只能说明剧本准备得越足。"
    think serious "My class and rank are all in class-group screenshots and school notices — personal info stopped being a secret long ago. The more a scammer knows, the better rehearsed the script."

# game/ch15.rpy:47
translate english ch15_A_16ae97df:

    # mc serious "王老师，收费是大事，我需要先和妈妈确认一下。"
    mc serious "Mr. Wang, fees are a big deal. I need to check with my mom first."

# game/ch15.rpy:48
translate english ch15_A_fc96a07a:

    # l15_teacher serious "都这么大了，这点小事还要问妈妈？5点就截止了，你一拖，全班资料都要耽误！"
    l15_teacher serious "You're big enough now and still asking your mom over such a trifle? Deadline is 5 p.m. — dawdle and the whole class misses their materials!"

# game/ch15.rpy:49
translate english ch15_A_a74902a5:

    # n "阿狐不再回复，翻出手机通讯录里存的真班主任号码，直接拨了过去——真王老师说：学校根本没有收费，她的账号前几天刚被盗过！"
    n "Ahu stopped replying, found the real head teacher's number saved in his contacts, and dialed — the real Mr. Wang said the school had no fees at all; her account had been hacked just days ago!"

# game/ch15.rpy:50
translate english ch15_A_8a1eaeff:

    # n "就在挂断电话的下一秒，一个陌生来电打了进来，自称「学校财务处」：同学你好，听说你在核实王老师收费的事？我们可以帮你查证……"
    n "The second he hung up, a strange call came in from the \"school finance office\": Hello, we hear you're verifying Mr. Wang's fee? We can check it for you..."

# game/ch15.rpy:51
translate english ch15_A_fe86532b:

    # think serious "等等——我还没跟任何人说我在核实，这个「财务处」怎么掐着点找上门？八成是骗子的同伙，专门蹲在「核实」这一步守株待兔！"
    think serious "Wait — I haven't told anyone I was verifying. How did this \"finance office\" show up right on cue? It must be the scammer's accomplice, lying in wait at exactly the verification step!"

# game/ch15.rpy:52
translate english ch15_A_b12d8cc9:

    # mc serious "谢谢，不用了。核实我自己会打学校官方电话，再见。"
    mc serious "Thanks, but no. I'll verify through the school's official line myself. Goodbye."

# game/ch15.rpy:53
translate english ch15_A_c486f5dc:

    # n "阿狐挂断、拉黑了全部陌生号码，把「王老师」的诈骗记录发给真老师。真老师随即在班级群发出预警，隔壁班两个已经转了钱的同学看到预警，及时报了警。"
    n "Ahu hung up and blocked every strange number, then sent the scam records to the real teacher, who immediately posted a warning in the class group. Two students in the next class who had already paid saw the warning and reported to the police in time."

# game/ch15.rpy:56
translate english ch15_A_9eff3da4:

    # mom laugh "儿子，你今天最厉害的不是识破了骗局，而是从头到尾没碰任何骗子递过来的渠道。"
    mom laugh "Son, what was most impressive today wasn't spotting the scam — it's that you never once touched a channel the scammer handed you."

# game/ch15.rpy:57
translate english ch15_A_93fffdbb:

    # police laugh "满分通关！高级骗局最擅长「抢先一步」：你刚起疑，假「财务处」就主动上门帮你「核实」。记住：核实永远只用自己存好的号码——骗子能伪造渠道，却伪造不了你手里的电话簿！"
    police laugh "Perfect run! Advanced scams excel at \"staying one step ahead\": the moment you got suspicious, a fake \"finance office\" offered to \"verify\" for you. Remember: verify only with numbers you saved yourself — scammers can fake channels, but not your own contact list!"

# game/ch15.rpy:69
translate english ch15_B_ce7c37b6:

    # mc confused "王老师，学校收费不是都走班级群的小程序吗？为什么转您的私人账户呀？"
    mc confused "Mr. Wang, doesn't the school always collect fees through the class-group mini program? Why transfer to your personal account?"

# game/ch15.rpy:70
translate english ch15_B_a8a88e68:

    # l15_teacher serious "这次是上面临时摊派的紧急费用，走程序来不及了！你是班干部，要带头交。"
    l15_teacher serious "This is an urgent last-minute levy from above — no time for procedures! You're a class officer, so lead the way."

# game/ch15.rpy:71
translate english ch15_B_f571b92b:

    # n "对方接连甩出三张图：仿真的「学校通知」、盖着红章的「收费文件」、还有一张「已交费名单」——班长、学习委员，阿狐熟悉的名字一个个都在上面。"
    n "The scammer fired off three images: an imitation of the \"school notice\", a red-stamped \"fee document\", and a \"paid list\" — class monitor, study committee member, name after familiar name."

# game/ch15.rpy:72
translate english ch15_B_da1f91b0:

    # l15_teacher laugh "这样，你先交，老师私下返你5元跑腿费，就当辛苦费。名单你都看到了，还能有假？"
    l15_teacher laugh "Tell you what — pay first and I'll slip you a 5-yuan errand fee for your trouble. You've seen the list yourself. How could it be fake?"

# game/ch15.rpy:73
translate english ch15_B_6f4fea98:

    # think confused "文件、名单、跑腿费全齐了……可越是这样，我心里越不踏实。"
    think confused "Document, list, errand fee — all complete... yet the more complete it looks, the less steady I feel."

# game/ch15.rpy:74
translate english ch15_B_8cee8733:

    # l15_teacher serious "4点半前必须交齐，财务处要统一上报！全班就差你和另外两个同学了！"
    l15_teacher serious "All fees must be in by 4:30 for the finance office's report! You and two others are the only ones left in the whole class!"

# game/ch15.rpy:88
translate english ch15_B1_cba86ea9:

    # n "阿狐翻出通讯录里存的真班主任号码——不是对方发来的任何号码——拨了过去。"
    n "Ahu dug out the real head teacher's number from his contacts — not any number the scammer had sent — and dialed."

# game/ch15.rpy:89
translate english ch15_B1_9d6bfdc3:

    # n "真王老师明确说：学校没有任何收费，她的头像和昵称上周就被骗子盗用了，已经有外班同学上当！"
    n "The real Mr. Wang was unequivocal: the school has no fees, her avatar and nickname were stolen by scammers last week, and students from another class have already fallen for it!"

# game/ch15.rpy:90
translate english ch15_B1_780947f5:

    # mc worried "老师，那个骗子还在用您的头像骗人，我把聊天记录全发给您！"
    mc worried "Teacher, that scammer is still using your avatar to cheat people — I'm sending you the full chat records!"

# game/ch15.rpy:91
translate english ch15_B1_e6201e93:

    # n "阿狐把证据完整转给真老师，又给妈妈打了电话。妈妈陪他向反诈平台提交了线索。"
    n "Ahu handed every piece of evidence to the real teacher and called Mom, who helped him submit the tip to the anti-fraud platform."

# game/ch15.rpy:92
translate english ch15_B1_f120c669:

    # n "另一边，「王老师」还在垂死挣扎，发来一张伪造的「教师工作证」。"
    n "Meanwhile, \"Mr. Wang\" was still struggling on, sending a forged \"teacher's ID card\"."

# game/ch15.rpy:93
translate english ch15_B1_956d6990:

    # l15_teacher serious "你看清楚，这是我的工作证！再不交真的来不及了！"
    l15_teacher serious "Look carefully — this is my teacher's ID! Pay now or it'll really be too late!"

# game/ch15.rpy:94
translate english ch15_B1_f1a52080:

    # mc serious "真老师刚刚和我通过电话，学校根本没有收费。工作证是P的，我已经全部举报了！"
    mc serious "The real teacher just spoke with me by phone — the school has no fees. That ID is photoshopped, and I've reported everything!"

# game/ch15.rpy:95
translate english ch15_B1_71f49e65:

    # n "对方瞬间沉默，账号很快注销。当晚，真老师在班级群发出防骗预警，全班同学都躲过了这一劫。"
    n "The other side fell silent, and the account was soon deleted. That evening the real teacher posted an anti-fraud warning in the class group, and the whole class dodged the bullet."

# game/ch15.rpy:101
translate english ch15_B1_3841625b:

    # mom laugh "从头到尾只用自己手里的号码核实，还顺手保护了全班同学，妈妈真为你骄傲！"
    mom laugh "You verified only with numbers in your own hands — and protected the whole class along the way. Mom is so proud of you!"

# game/ch15.rpy:102
translate english ch15_B1_3cf08a06:

    # police laugh "双核实加零使用骗子渠道，满分！伪造的通知、名单、证件可以以假乱真，但「自己拨出去的核实电话」永远是照妖镜！"
    police laugh "Double verification, zero use of scammer channels — full marks! Forged notices, lists, and IDs can look utterly real, but the verification call you dial yourself is always the demon-revealing mirror!"

# game/ch15.rpy:111
translate english ch15_B2_6442421e:

    # mc serious "不交。要收费就发班级群正式通知，私人账户免谈。"
    mc serious "Not paying. Post a formal notice in the class group; personal accounts are off the table."

# game/ch15.rpy:112
translate english ch15_B2_4aba31bc:

    # n "阿狐把对方拉黑，转身打游戏去了，没有把这件事告诉任何人。"
    n "Ahu blocked them and went back to his game, telling no one what had happened."

# game/ch15.rpy:113
translate english ch15_B2_65c5db16:

    # n "三天后，班主任在班会上严肃提醒：有骗子冒充她收取「资料费」，班上和阿狐要好的两个同学，各被骗了200元。"
    n "Three days later, the head teacher gravely warned the class: a scammer impersonating her had collected \"materials fees\" — two of Ahu's good friends each lost 200 yuan."

# game/ch15.rpy:114
translate english ch15_B2_3044218d:

    # mc sad "我三天前就遇到过那个骗子……要是我当时在群里说一声，他们就不会上当……"
    mc sad "I ran into that scammer three days ago... If I'd said something in the group then, they wouldn't have been fooled..."

# game/ch15.rpy:115
translate english ch15_B2_4e41bb84:

    # n "阿狐把完整经历告诉了老师。老师肯定了他没上当，也指出：反诈不只像考试答对题，识破之后的「报告和预警」，才能保护更多的人。"
    n "Ahu told the teacher the whole story. She affirmed that he hadn't been fooled, but pointed out: anti-fraud isn't just answering test questions right — the reporting and warnings after you see through a scam are what protect more people."

# game/ch15.rpy:118
translate english ch15_B2_c85009f9:

    # police serious "你守住了自己的钱包，很好。但请记住：识破骗局后沉默，骗局就会转身去找下一个目标。举报、预警、告诉大人——反诈的最后一环，是保护别人。"
    police serious "You protected your own wallet — good. But remember: stay silent after seeing through a scam, and it simply turns to the next target. Report, warn, tell adults — the final link of anti-fraud is protecting others."

# game/ch15.rpy:130
translate english ch15_B3_240283bf:

    # n "名单、红头文件、跑腿费，三样凑齐，阿狐信了，转出200元「资料费」。"
    n "List, red-stamped document, errand fee — with all three in place, Ahu believed it and transferred the 200-yuan \"materials fee\"."

# game/ch15.rpy:131
translate english ch15_B3_0a19f107:

    # think laugh "还倒赚5元跑腿费，真老师就是细心。"
    think laugh "Plus a 5-yuan errand fee on top — the real teacher is so thoughtful."

# game/ch15.rpy:132
translate english ch15_B3_8278c9d6:

    # l15_teacher serious "收到！另外学校刚补发通知，还要加收500元「试卷印刷费」，你和名单上的同学一并交齐，我统一登记！"
    l15_teacher serious "Received! Also, the school just issued a supplementary notice adding a 500-yuan \"exam printing fee\" — pay that too with the others on the list, and I'll register you all at once!"

# game/ch15.rpy:133
translate english ch15_B3_52f06c52:

    # mc confused "怎么交完200又是500？一学期哪来这么多临时收费？"
    mc confused "200 paid, now another 500? Since when does one semester have this many surprise fees?"

# game/ch15.rpy:134
translate english ch15_B3_a3c74b49:

    # n "阿狐终于起疑，用自己存的号码拨通真老师电话——学校根本没有收费！"
    n "Suspicion finally stirred, and Ahu dialed the real teacher on his own saved number — the school had no fees at all!"

# game/ch15.rpy:135
translate english ch15_B3_8194da21:

    # n "再回聊天框，红色感叹号：已被拉黑。那200元，连同幻想中的5元跑腿费，一起进了骗子的口袋。"
    n "Back in the chat: red exclamation marks. He'd been blocked. The 200 yuan — along with the imagined 5-yuan errand fee — went straight into the scammer's pocket."

# game/ch15.rpy:138
translate english ch15_B3_e383f753:

    # police serious "骗局的「配方」你明明闻出了不对，却还是咽了下去——因为名单、文件、小甜头，每一味都在替你壮胆。记住：再逼真的「证据」都能伪造，唯一造不了假的，是你自己拨出去的核实电话。"
    police serious "You smelled something off in the scam's \"recipe\", yet swallowed it anyway — because every ingredient, from list to document to sweetener, buoyed your courage. Remember: the most convincing \"evidence\" can be forged. The one thing that can't: the verification call you dial yourself."

# game/ch15.rpy:150
translate english ch15_C_8d8469e0:

    # n "阿狐先点了「礼包链接」，在仿真官网填了游戏账号和密码；又给「王老师」转了200元资料费，忙得不亦乐乎。"
    n "Ahu tapped the \"pack link\" first, entering his game account and password on the counterfeit official page; then he paid Mr. Wang the 200-yuan fee, busy as could be."

# game/ch15.rpy:151
translate english ch15_C_2306f605:

    # think laugh "名次被老师夸，礼包到手，资料费交齐——今天双喜临门！"
    think laugh "Praised by the teacher, the pack claimed, the fee paid — a double-red-letter day!"

# game/ch15.rpy:152
translate english ch15_C_ba84b1c0:

    # n "他没有留意，「礼包页面」的最后一步，悄悄要求填写手机短信验证码——他也填了。"
    n "He didn't notice that the \"pack page's\" final step quietly asked for an SMS verification code — and he entered it."

# game/ch15.rpy:153
translate english ch15_C_325930f8:

    # n "十分钟后，风暴来了。一个陌生电话打了进来。"
    n "Ten minutes later, the storm hit. A strange call came in."

# game/ch15.rpy:154
translate english ch15_C_ca05259b:

    # l15_cop serious "我是反诈中心李警官！监测到你的游戏账号涉嫌洗钱，两小时内不配合资金清查，将冻结你全家的银行账户！"
    l15_cop serious "This is Officer Li from the anti-fraud center! Your game account is implicated in money laundering. Refuse the funds check within two hours and your whole family's bank accounts will be frozen!"

# game/ch15.rpy:155
translate english ch15_C_f5892efc:

    # n "紧接着，「妈妈」在QQ上发来一条语音——声音、语气和妈妈一模一样。"
    n "Right after, \"Mom\" sent a voice message on QQ — the voice and tone exactly like hers."

# game/ch15.rpy:156
translate english ch15_C_81fe1997:

    # mom serious "儿子，是妈妈。警察叔叔刚联系过我了，你按叔叔说的做，把验证码报给叔叔，妈妈这边都处理好了，别怕。"
    mom serious "Sweetie, it's Mom. The police officer just contacted me. Do as he says — read the verification code to him. It's all handled on my end. Don't be afraid."

# game/ch15.rpy:157
translate english ch15_C_457added:

    # n "与此同时，那个「礼包页面」又弹出提示：检测到账户风险，请输入短信验证码，保护你的点券资产。"
    n "Meanwhile the \"pack page\" flashed another notice: account risk detected — enter the SMS verification code to protect your vouchers."

# game/ch15.rpy:158
translate english ch15_C_1a65303a:

    # think worried "警察、妈妈、官方页面……三方都让我交验证码。可为什么，他们像商量好了一样，一起来？"
    think worried "Police, Mom, the official page... all three demanding my code. But why do they arrive together, as if rehearsed?"

# game/ch15.rpy:172
translate english ch15_C1_7ccbe2d9:

    # n "盯着三路同时发难的屏幕，阿狐深吸一口气，做了这一年学到的最重要的动作——全部停下来。"
    n "Staring at three fronts attacking at once, Ahu took a deep breath and did the most important thing he'd learned all year — stopped everything."

# game/ch15.rpy:173
translate english ch15_C1_148973da:

    # think serious "真警察不会电话办案；真妈妈不会在QQ上让我给验证码；领礼包更不需要验证码。三条线同时催我交东西——这不是巧合，是排练好的连环局！"
    think serious "Real police don't work cases by phone; real Mom would never ask for a code on QQ; claiming a pack never needs one. Three lines pushing me to hand something over at once — that's not coincidence, it's a rehearsed chain trap!"

# game/ch15.rpy:174
translate english ch15_C1_d92ddfa2:

    # n "他没有回复任何一条来路不明的消息，而是拨打了妈妈的真实手机号，接通后先对了一遍家庭暗号。"
    n "He replied to none of the suspicious messages. Instead he dialed Mom's real cell number and, once connected, checked the family password first."

# game/ch15.rpy:175
translate english ch15_C1_f6bf6332:

    # mc serious "妈，我们的暗号是什么？"
    mc serious "Mom, what's our family password?"

# game/ch15.rpy:176
translate english ch15_C1_d6347675:

    # n "电话那头的妈妈一愣，随即报出了只有全家知道的那句话——这才是真妈妈。"
    n "Mom on the other end paused for a beat, then spoke the phrase only the family knew — this was the real Mom."

# game/ch15.rpy:177
translate english ch15_C1_d0bd0be2:

    # mom serious "儿子，妈妈在外面办事，手机一刻没离身，什么警察都没联系过我！那些全是假的，一个字都不能给！"
    mom serious "Sweetie, I'm out on errands and my phone hasn't left me for a second — no officer ever contacted me! It's all fake. Not one word, not one digit!"

# game/ch15.rpy:178
translate english ch15_C1_904cfc1e:

    # n "阿狐立刻报警备案，拉黑全部账号，卸载了钓鱼页面，把完整经过连同证据交给真老师和警察。"
    n "Ahu reported to the police at once, blocked every account, uninstalled the phishing page, and handed the full story with evidence to his real teacher and the police."

# game/ch15.rpy:179
translate english ch15_C1_c5289139:

    # n "由于报警及时，警方冻结了骗子的收款渠道；顺着阿狐提供的线索，隔壁班两个被「王老师」骗过的同学也追回了损失。"
    n "Because the report came fast, the police froze the scammer's payment channels; following Ahu's leads, two students from the next class who'd been cheated by \"Mr. Wang\" recovered their losses too."

# game/ch15.rpy:182
translate english ch15_C1_b4135cf0:

    # mom laugh "连「妈妈的声音」都敢伪造，你还是稳稳站在原地。妈妈为你骄傲！"
    mom laugh "They even dared to fake my voice — and you still stood firm. Mom is so proud of you!"

# game/ch15.rpy:183
translate english ch15_C1_338952db:

    # police laugh "终极试炼，满分通过！权威、亲情、恐吓三箭齐发，被你的「停一停」和「家庭暗号」一举破局。记住这条终极心法：来路不明的都是靶子，自己手里的号码才是路！"
    police laugh "Final trial passed with full marks! Authority, family love, and intimidation fired together — broken by your \"stop everything\" and the \"family password\". Remember the ultimate rule: anything of unknown origin is a target; the numbers in your own hands are the way!"

# game/ch15.rpy:195
translate english ch15_C2_5b47094c:

    # n "阿狐死死顶住了「李警官」的恐吓和钓鱼页面的催促，验证码一个字都没给。"
    n "Ahu held rock-firm against \"Officer Li's\" threats and the phishing page's urging — not one digit of the code was given."

# game/ch15.rpy:196
translate english ch15_C2_f0d775b6:

    # mc serious "我不给。真警察不电话办案，真妈妈不会在QQ上让我配合任何「叔叔」。"
    mc serious "I won't give it. Real police don't work cases by phone, and real Mom would never have me \"cooperate\" with some \"uncle\" on QQ."

# game/ch15.rpy:197
translate english ch15_C2_a9671a05:

    # n "电话瞬间挂断，「妈妈」的账号和钓鱼页面同时消失——三路骗局被一口气戳破。"
    n "The call cut instantly, and \"Mom's\" account and the phishing page vanished together — all three prongs punctured in one breath."

# game/ch15.rpy:198
translate english ch15_C2_2fea9b09:

    # n "但他还没来得及高兴，游戏账号突然被强制下线：那个「礼包页面」里填过的账号密码，早被骗子拿去登录了。"
    n "But before he could celebrate, his game account was forcibly logged out — the account and password entered on that \"pack page\" had long since been used by the scammer to log in."

# game/ch15.rpy:199
translate english ch15_C2_279d95e6:

    # n "等阿狐找回密码，账号里的皮肤和点券已被洗劫一空；转出去的200元「资料费」，自然也有去无回。"
    n "By the time Ahu recovered the password, every skin and voucher had been looted; the 200-yuan \"materials fee\", naturally, was never coming back either."

# game/ch15.rpy:200
translate english ch15_C2_676722e8:

    # mc sad "验证码我守住了，怎么还是丢了账号……原来从点开礼包那一刻，坑就已经挖好了……"
    mc sad "I held the code — how did I still lose the account...? So the pit was dug the moment I opened that pack page..."

# game/ch15.rpy:201
translate english ch15_C2_0a4bcc6c:

    # n "阿狐把全部经过告诉妈妈并报警。因为验证码没有泄露，家里的存款安然无恙；但游戏账号和200元，为他的轻敌买了单。"
    n "Ahu told Mom everything and reported to the police. With the code never leaked, the family's savings were untouched — but the game account and 200 yuan paid the price of his overconfidence."

# game/ch15.rpy:204
translate english ch15_C2_8e68cfc6:

    # police serious "最凶险的一关你守住了，值得表扬！但连环骗局环环相扣——前面贪的每一步、多填的每一次，都是在给最后一环埋雷。反诈没有「前面随便点、后面我机灵」，从第一步就要干净！"
    police serious "You held the most dangerous pass — well done! But a chain scam links ring to ring: every greedy step and every extra field you filled early was a mine laid for the last ring. There's no \"click freely early, get clever late\" in anti-fraud — stay clean from step one!"

# game/ch15.rpy:216
translate english ch15_C3_76ed2331:

    # n "「妈妈」的声音成了压垮理智的最后一根稻草。阿狐把手机收到的验证码，一条条报给了「李警官」。"
    n "\"Mom's\" voice was the last straw that crushed reason. Ahu read the verification codes off the phone to \"Officer Li\", one by one."

# game/ch15.rpy:217
translate english ch15_C3_95a9a4e0:

    # n "几分钟后，妈妈手机接连弹出扣款短信：银行卡被转走36000元，支付余额清零。"
    n "Minutes later, deduction texts flooded Mom's phone: 36,000 yuan transferred from the bank card, the payment balance drained to zero."

# game/ch15.rpy:218
translate english ch15_C3_b3e93289:

    # n "紧接着，游戏账号被顶下线——皮肤、点券被洗劫一空；交给「王老师」的200元资料费，自然也是有去无回。"
    n "Then the game account was forcibly logged out — skins and vouchers looted clean; the 200-yuan materials fee paid to \"Mr. Wang\", of course, was gone for good."

# game/ch15.rpy:219
translate english ch15_C3_af36f639:

    # n "最可怕的是：晚上，阿狐的游戏账号给全班同学群发了消息——「我是阿狐，家里出急事，借我200，明天还」，骗子正冒用他的身份，骗他的朋友。"
    n "Worst of all: that evening, Ahu's game account mass-messaged the whole class — \"It's Ahu. Family emergency. Lend me 200, I'll pay you back tomorrow.\" The scammer was using his identity to cheat his friends."

# game/ch15.rpy:220
translate english ch15_C3_924d2775:

    # n "同桌差点就转了钱，还好多留了个心眼，先给阿狐妈妈打了电话。"
    n "His deskmate nearly transferred the money — luckily he stayed a little wary and called Ahu's mom first."

# game/ch15.rpy:221
translate english ch15_C3_e6dca6a6:

    # mc sad "我不仅害了全家……还差点害了同学……"
    mc sad "I didn't just hurt my family... I almost hurt my classmates too..."

# game/ch15.rpy:222
translate english ch15_C3_9f7d6171:

    # n "妈妈回家后，阿狐哭着交代了一切。妈妈报警、冻结账户、在班级群发出预警，所幸同学们都看到了提醒，没有第二个家庭被骗。"
    n "When Mom came home, Ahu confessed everything in tears. She reported to the police, froze the accounts, and posted a warning in the class group — thankfully everyone saw the alert, and no second family was cheated."

# game/ch15.rpy:223
translate english ch15_C3_0a4c89d7:

    # mom normal "钱可以再赚。你要记住：骗局最狡猾的地方，就是让受骗的人，变成骗局的一部分。"
    mom normal "Money can be earned again. But remember: a scam's cleverest trick is turning its victim into part of the scam."

# game/ch15.rpy:226
translate english ch15_C3_37ffbcd1:

    # police serious "小朋友记住！终极试炼的连环局：假老师骗信任、假警察造恐慌、假亲声做「背书」，最后用验证码收网。破解它只需要四句话：免费不点、转账必核、验证码不给、拿不准就用自己的号码找家人和警察。守住这四句，谁也骗不了你！"
    police serious "Kids, remember! The final trial's chain: a fake teacher to win trust, a fake officer to spark panic, a fake family voice to \"vouch\" — then the code is how they close the net. Breaking it takes just four lines: don't tap freebies, verify every transfer, never give codes, and when unsure, reach family and police on numbers you saved yourself. Hold these four, and no one can ever fool you!"

translate english strings:

    # game/ch15.rpy:34
    old "信息越「准」越要警惕——先放一边，用自己存的号码打给真老师核实"
    new "The more \"accurate\" the info, the warier I get — set it aside, call the real teacher on my own saved number"

    # game/ch15.rpy:36
    old "礼包链接不敢点，但「王老师」说得有鼻子有眼，回复再问问"
    new "Too scared to tap the pack link, but \"Mr. Wang\" sounds so convincing — reply and probe"

    # game/ch15.rpy:38
    old "期中名次都说对了，肯定是真的——先领礼包，再交资料费"
    new "He got my midterm rank right, so it must be real — claim the pack, then pay the fee"

    # game/ch15.rpy:77
    old "甜头也好、名单也好，先打真老师电话核实再说"
    new "Sweetener or list aside — call the real teacher to verify first"

    # game/ch15.rpy:79
    old "不转钱，直接拉黑，眼不见为净"
    new "No transfer — block them and be done with it"

    # game/ch15.rpy:81
    old "名单都交了，老师还倒贴跑腿费——转200元"
    new "Everyone on the list paid and teacher's even adding an errand fee — transfer the 200"

    # game/ch15.rpy:161
    old "全部停下来！只用我自己的号码，一条一条反向核实"
    new "Stop everything! Verify each one in reverse, using only my own numbers"

    # game/ch15.rpy:163
    old "顶住警察和页面，可「妈妈」都发话了……再看看"
    new "Hold out against the police and the page, but \"Mom\" spoke up... wait and see"

    # game/ch15.rpy:165
    old "妈妈都说没事了——按「李警官」说的全部照做"
    new "Even Mom says it's fine — do everything \"Officer Li\" says"

