# game/ch15.rpy:95
translate english ch15_B1_4bfc9a44:

    # n "对方瞬间沉默，账号很快注销。当晚，真王老师亲自打来视频电话，向阿狐道谢。"
    n "The other side fell silent instantly, and the account was soon deleted. That evening, the real Mr. Wang video-called Ahu personally to thank him."

# game/ch15.rpy:96
translate english ch15_B1_d7f6396f:

    # teacher serious "阿狐，谢谢你第一时间告诉我，还保留好了所有证据。我马上在班级群里发预警，大家千万不能向私人账户转账！"
    teacher serious "Ahu, thank you for telling me right away and keeping all the evidence. I'm posting a warning in the class group immediately — no one transfers anything to personal accounts!"

# game/ch15.rpy:97
translate english ch15_B1_3352037f:

    # teacher laugh "先核实、再行动，还知道提醒同学——老师要在班会上好好表扬你！"
    teacher laugh "Verify first, act second, and you even thought to warn your classmates — I'm going to praise you in front of the whole class!"

# game/ch15.rpy:98
translate english ch15_B1_12c70baa:

    # n "预警发出后，全班同学都躲过了这波冒充老师的骗局。"
    n "With the warning out, the whole class dodged this teacher-impersonation scam."

